LLM Integration – Connect to models like Groq, Gemini, or OpenAI.
----------------------------------------------------------------

Prompt Templates – Create reusable prompts.
Output Parsers – Structure model responses.
Tools – Extend the agent with capabilities.
Agents – Decide which tool to use automatically.
Memory – Maintain conversation context.
Document Loaders – Import PDFs, CSVs, and other documents.
Embeddings – Convert text into vectors.
Vector Stores (FAISS/ChromaDB/Pinecone) – Store and search embeddings.
Retrievers (RAG) – Fetch relevant information from your knowledge base.
